        'profession' => 'Environmental Conservation and People’s Movements',
        'portrait' => null,
        'en' => [
            'title' => 'V. Krishnakumar',
            'summary' => 'V. Krishnakumar has worked with community groups on environmental conservation and protection of shared local resources.',
            'body' => "V. Krishnakumar has worked with community groups on environmental conservation and protection of shared local resources.\n\nHis activities have included awareness programmes and local initiatives concerning waste reduction, water conservation and neighbourhood green spaces. He prefers practical community action to abstract messaging and has encouraged residents and young people to take ownership of local projects.\n\nHis approach is based on the idea that environmental responsibility becomes stronger when people see its direct connection with the health of their own communities.",
